WEBVTT

00:03:00.076 --> 00:03:01.676
They didn't appear.

00:03:02.556 --> 00:03:06.356
Not even once in the world's
climate agreement.

00:03:08.316 --> 00:03:14.636
The fossil fuel industry has been
successful in making itself invisible.

00:03:16.716 --> 00:03:21.996
I started reaching out
and met with, for several years,

00:03:22.036 --> 00:03:25.116
the CEOs of major oil companies

00:03:25.156 --> 00:03:27.396
because I wanted to understand

00:03:27.436 --> 00:03:31.196
what these CEOs see
when they read the science.